# rena0-guard-gate-legacy — F1-3 fixture, P2-7 guard family
# The same guarded contact WITHOUT the recovered gate: this is the legacy default path, whose
# guarded damage is the provisional port rule inside take_damage (20%, floored at 1, with the
# comment saying the original's gate is unmapped). 8 damage therefore becomes 1.
#
# This fixture is the flag-off restoration evidence at fixture level: it must keep showing the
# legacy outcome while rena0-guard-gate-pilot.fixture shows the recovered one, and the two
# differ only by the `pilot rena0-guard` directive.
# Body separation off: the dummy is held on the attack volume, inside the 60-unit radius
# (V3-45's open item).
body_separation 0
combo 0 0
seed 5489
spawn 0 0 0 0
spawn 1 0 0 300
collision open-field
dummy_guard 1
input 0 MELEE
place_at_attack active
expect 15 melee_hit 1
expect 16 dummy_hp 99
expect 16 dummy_ko 0
